   "text": "So right now, they're testing out a couple different AI systems to replicate a lot of what the physics- based models are using, and they're showing a lot of promise. As I was saying earlier, I think the benefit there is you save on computational resources, at least for the operational prediction system, but you still need to generate the training datasets.",
